&rsquo;s 4 grids. June to July came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025, August to September came in at 24% of normal and January to February at 20%. All 4 grids had their driest year in 1953, with grid 23857 at 55%.</p>"}
